    "content": "<style class=\"gs-qual-css\">\n/* v7 skin: donor quality section (research/donor-v7.html:309-327). Every line restates a\n   claim already shipped in the previous verified quality block (ISO 22000, Halal,\n   Cook & Chill, MAP, lab checks — all from Olive's published material); «регулярный»\n   deliberately replaces the donor's unverified «каждой партии». Photos are Olive's own\n   olive.kz assets, curl-verified 200 (SKIN_V7 §4), backgrounds with silent fallback. */\n.gs-qual__imgs{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:10px;margin:24px 0}\n.gs-qual__imgs .gs-imgbox{aspect-ratio:3/4;border-radius:16px}\n.gs-qual__img--1{background:url(\"/assets/images/quality/1.webp\") center/cover no-repeat,linear-gradient(140deg,#DCEBC4,#C3DF9C)}\n.gs-qual__img--2{background:url(\"/assets/images/quality/2.webp\") center/cover no-repeat,linear-gradient(140deg,#DCEBC4,#C3DF9C)}\n.gs-qual__img--3{background:url(\"/assets/images/quality/3.webp\") center/cover no-repeat,linear-gradient(140deg,#DCEBC4,#C3DF9C)}\n.gs-qual__list{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;text-align:left}\n.gs-qual__list li{padding:16px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--gs7-line,rgba(32,39,26,.12));\n  font:800 clamp(1.1875rem,4.6vw,1.625rem)/1.25 var(--gs-display,system-ui,sans-serif);\n  letter-spacing:-.03em;color:var(--gs7-ink,#20271A)}\n.gs-qual__list li:last-child{border-bottom:none}\n.gs-qual__list li small{display:block;margin-top:2px;font:500 var(--gs-fs-sm,.875rem)/1.4 var(--gs-text,sans-serif);\n  color:var(--gs7-muted,#697260);letter-spacing:0}\n</style>\n<section class=\"gs-sec\" id=\"gsQuality\" aria-labelledby=\"gsQualH\">\n  <div class=\"gs-wrap\">\n    <div class=\"gs-center\"><h2 class=\"gs-h2\" id=\"gsQualH\">Контроль качества</h2></div>\n    <div class=\"gs-qual__imgs\">\n      <div class=\"gs-imgbox gs-imgbox--photo gs-qual__img--1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n      <div class=\"gs-imgbox gs-imgbox--photo gs-qual__img--2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n      <div class=\"gs-imgbox gs-imgbox--photo gs-qual__img--3\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n    </div>\n    <ul class=\"gs-qual__list\">\n      <li>Международный стандарт ISO 22000<small>собственное сертифицированное производство в Алматы</small></li>\n      <li>Сертификат Халал</li>\n      <li>Технология Cook &amp; Chill<small>сохраняет свежесть и вкус без консервантов</small></li>\n      <li>Упаковка MAP<small>газомодифицированная среда</small></li>\n      <li>Регулярный лабораторный контроль<small>образцы проверяются в независимых лабораториях</small></li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n</section>"
  }
}
